  "CIO_paragraphs": [
    "The unchanged balanced score now ranks KNTNF, WDOFF, LUGDF, DPMLF and KGC first through fifth. K92's vendor financial quarter is still June 30; its issuer scheduled Q3 financial results for November 16. Price freshness and a first-place relative rank do not establish a fresh quarterly earnings confirmation.",
